        id: 'Kata is adalah "adalah". The light is on: Lampu menyala. The light is off: tidak aktif. Dan not setelah is memberikan "tidak": The light is not on.',
        tr: 'is kelimesi "dir"dir. The light is on: Işık açık. The light is off: kapalı. Ve is\'dan sonra not "hayır" verir: The light is not on.',
        pl: 'Słowo is to „jest”. The light is on: Światło jest włączone. The light is off: jest wyłączony. A not po is daje „nie”: The light is not on.',
