        uk: 'З попередніх днів ти знаєш there is / there are — вони допомагають сказати, що стоїть на столі. There is some juice on the table. There are eggs in the fridge.',
        es: 'De los días anteriores conoces there is / there are — sirven para decir qué hay en la mesa. There is some juice on the table. There are eggs in the fridge.',
        'pt-BR': 'Dos dias anteriores você sabe lá is / lá are — eles servem para dizer o que está na mesa. There is some suco on the table. There are eggs in the fridge.',
